OL,3,GNEWSAChef who quit after 'mushy peas'
OL,4,Arow with boss gets #34,000 payout
OL,5,
OL,6,FA chef who quit her restaurant job
OL,7,Fafter clashing with her boss in a row
OL,8,Finvolving mushy peas has been awarded
OL,9,F#34,000 for unfair dismissal.
OL,11,FElma Booth said the row was the final
OL,12,Fstraw after a series of disputes with
OL,13,FHaydar Baran at La Mirage in Helmsdale,
OL,14,FSutherland.
OL,16,FShe told an employment tribunal Baran
OL,17,Finterrupted service to tell her to give
OL,18,Fpriority to regular customers at the
OL,19,Frestaurant, which is on the North Coast
OL,20,F500 tourist route. That included
OL,21,Fconcentrating on a dish which featured
OL,22,Fmushy peas.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
